ing him upon looking  closer he quickly uses his harpoon to  fend them off a swarm of butterflies  surround him but he now dives into the  nearby river to get rid of them  fortunately he survives this deadly  attack after covering some more distance  inside the dungeon he discovers the gate  to the treasure room when he knows about  to reach the door suddenly a crab  monster attacks him and lands a slash on  his back he falls into the river with  the beast he now gathers all his  strength by reminding himself that he's  not a coward anymore and charges the  harpoon towards the crab monster after a  massive splash of water he throws the  beast out of the water and dashes  forward to land the final blow but the  assassins kill the monster before him  much to his dismay dragon and his team  take the crystal to open the treasure  room he now takes a stand for himself  and he tells him to give him the crystal  as he's the one who reached it first he  displays his insane strength and a fight  begins between them he now faces off  against the trio of assassins at first  he dominates the fighting but he gets  trapped in their combined attack just  when the lead is about to kill him  sinbad intervenes and uses the power of  baal to stop them drago greets him in  his usual sulking manner the mage with  dragon introduces herself as farlan the  leader of the assassin squad attack  sinbad as he's bent on killing him a  fight breaks again between them hina  gets dragged into this as well sinbad  tries to use his power but dragon  attacks him with a gun to stop him he  knight steps in and dives into the river  with sinbad to escape the scene farlan  uses her magic to freeze the river but  fortunately they survive it draggle  wonders about the real identity of this  mage she gives the team three magic  pills to boost their powers and after  taking the pills they feel much lighter  and more powerful draggle inserts the  crystal and walks into the treasure room  with its companions on the other hand  sinbad gets out from the freezing water  heena tells him he'll claim the  dungeon's power to which sinbad tells  him that he's already strong enough the  scene shifts to dragol who summoned the  jinn of the dungeon the jinn emerges  from the metal vessel and claims to be  the gin of deception and confidence he  recognizes the evil scent of fallen and  destroys her puppet doll dragon tells  the jin that he'll become king and he'll  give power to the majesty which bores  him to the point he turns into a cute  cat sinbad and hina reach the treasure  room jin presents them with a challenge  to catch a cat made from his blood they  all decide to claim the power for  themselves and dash forward to catch the  cat but the cat turns out to be very  fast much to their dismay after several  failed attempts sinbad asks them to work  together he manipulates them by telling  them he won't participate in the  combined attack the cat jumps when they  dash towards her and simba quickly  catches it they lash at him calling him  a traitor but sinbad makes an exciting  speech that must claim this power to  change the world and he'd love to have  all of them as his followers they end up  getting passionate after listening to  his speech after all simbad is born to  lead people as a king the assassin squad  suddenly goes berserk because of the  magic pills given to them by far land  they become a source of black power that  summons a giant demon dragon tries to  kill them but sinbad stops him because  he wants to save them the demon attacks  them with his massive power leaving  simbad injured hina and drago step in to  stop the demon but it's all in vain jin  reveals that they can save them if they  manage to destroy the demon's heart in a  single attack sinbad lands an attack on  the demon but farlan in his illusionary  body takes the sword of sinbad away to  prevent him from using jin's power hina  finally acknowledges sinbad as a  powerful man and declares him a king  vessel together they decide to unleash a  final attack simba dashes forward as a  decoy while hina charges his harpoon to  land the final blow however the demon  catches sinbad and makes him suffer  dragon lands an attack on the face of  the demon that helps sinbad to escape  finally hina unleashes his charged  harpoon which pierces the demon's heart  in a single go leaving fine and everyone  in shock sinbad takes advantage of this  moment to claim back his sword by  destroying the dollar farland however  the situation is unclear because the  assassin's leader's heart has fallen in  iniquity and the demon is using him to  revive himself simba takes the challenge  and tries to save him sinbad discovers  his memories of being forced into a  ruthless assassin upon holding his hand  sinbad finds him crying in his memories  because the organization forced him to  kill his parents sinbad saves him by  convincing him that they won't let  anyone use him in the future he uses the  power of baal to destroy the reviving  demon the assassin leader comes back  from depravity with the help of sinbad  that surprises everyone even jin they  all bow before simbad and tell him to  claim power because he is the true king  after forming a pact with jinn the  dungeon disappears and they all find  themselves back in the village dragon  leaves were saying he must save someone  in the empire while leaving drago  receives a portion of jin's power  because he's acknowledged sinbad as his  king hina decided to follow sinbad on  his journey as his follower they meet  the villagers founder who turns out to  be a giant furious man finally he now  gets permission from the chief and his  daughter becomes his wife  sinbad forms a diplomatic relationship  with hina's village that marks the  beginning of his future trade company  with two jin's powers in his hand what  will be the next destination of simbad  the future king of the seven seas  continue watching from episode seven to  discover more a